SEcTfoN 1' The City of Rector, Arkansas, hereby releases, vacates andabandons all its rights, together with the rights of the public generally, in and toan alley designated as follows:Beginning at the southwest corner of Lot 1 , Block 10 of theoriginal rown of Rector, Arkansas, and due North along the westboundary line of Lot 1, 2 and 3, to the Northwest cornei of Lot 3,thence due west 20 feet to the Northeast corner of Lot 10, thencedue south along the east boundary line of Lot 10, 11 and 1i, to thesoutheast corner of Lot 12, thenie East 20 feet to the southwestCorner of Lot 1, the point of beginning.SECTION 2' A copy of the ordinance duly certified by the City Recordershall be filed in the Office of the Circuit Clerk and Ex-Officio Recorder of thecounty and recorder in the deed records for the Eastern District of Clay County.ISECTION 3. This ordinance shall take effect and be in force from and
after its passage.Passed and. approved by the
City Council of the City of Rector, this, 2005.
