NOTICE OF HEARINGNotice is hereby given that there has been filed in the Office of the CityRecorder, Rector, Arkansas, a petition purporting to be signed by all the abuttingland owner by and through its attorney, C. Joseph Calvin, to vacate a certainalley within the City of Rector, Arkansas.The petitioner states that it is the sole abutting land owner and that thesaid alley has not been used for a period of five years from the date of thisnotice.Beginning at the southwest corner of Lot i, Block 10 of thel3riginal rown of Rector, Arkansas, and due North along the westboundary line of Lot 1, 2 and 3, to the Northwest cornei of Lot 3,l,hence due west 20 feet to the Northeast corner of Lot 10, thencedue south along the east boundary line of Lot 10, 1 1 and 12, to thesoutheast corner of Lot 12, thence East 20 feet to the southwestCorner of Lot 1, the point of beginning.Petitioner. First United Methodist Church
